  "description": "Liam Wang comes from a proud otaku family. However, after a painful childhood experience, Liam decides to \"retire\" from being an otaku and embarks on a normal life. Years later at school, he unintentionally makes otaku friends of various sorts. At first, he strongly refuses them but then slowly opens up to the life he had once thrown away. Once an OTAKU, always an OTAKU?\nSource: Lezhin",
